                            <comment id="13425240" author="gsingers" created="Mon, 30 Jul 2012 21:09:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hey Tim,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is there a workaround for this for 0.7 that you are aware of other than overriding the method?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13425245" author="srowen" created="Mon, 30 Jul 2012 21:13:43 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Grant I committed his one-liner patch a while ago.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="13425275" author="gsingers" created="Mon, 30 Jul 2012 21:44:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Sean, I know.  It&apos;s just not released and I&apos;m trying to upgrade to 0.7 and hitting this and I wanted to avoid being on trunk or a patched version so I was curious if there was a workaround.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
